# Deep Research Workflows

> Use the Agent API medium effort level for comprehensive, multi-step research tasks — synchronous usage, batch concurrency, result processing, and production patterns

This guide shows how to use the Agent API's `medium` effort level for comprehensive, multi-step research tasks. Deep research performs extended web research, following chains of sources and synthesizing detailed answers. You will learn how to run deep research queries, process results, handle long-running requests, and run batch research workflows.

> [!NOTE]
>
> The `medium` effort level on the Agent API performs multi-step web research, following chains of sources and synthesizing comprehensive answers. It automatically selects the best model and configures tools for deep research. For more on effort levels, see the [Agent API Effort Levels](https://docs.perplexity.ai/docs/agent-api/effort.md) docs.

